    "Khasi vowel-length (and lexical-quality) pronunciation lexicon.",
    "Vowel length is phonemic in Khasi but UNMARKED in the orthography",
    "(War 2001 pp.49-54: kam 'work' /kaːm/ vs kam 'stride' /kam/), so it is",
